  offerLine: It IS you. I heard you were back, and I said no, that one never comes back for anything. And then I heard about this... place.
  activeLine: Don't just stand there with your mouth open. Come here.
  readyLine: You're really doing this? Here. It's not a housewarming gift, it's a mercy. Those walls need hiding.
  doneLine: We'll see. I'm staying a while.
